5718	5732	Gender quotas

5732	5838	In addition to local government reform, Hogan also introduced reform within the political party framework.
5839	5938	As part of a series of reforms, he introduced measures to support female participation in politics.
5939	5984	The Electoral (Amendment) (Political Funding)
5985	6189	Bill 2011 would see parties lose half of their central exchequer funding unless the minority sex among their candidates accounts for 30 per cent of the entire national ticket at the next general elect
6190	6300	The reform was brought in successfully alongside additional amendments to party political funding mechanisms.

6300	6484	In advance of the 2016 General Election, Hogan noted that "this legislation has had the unprecedented effect of all major political parties selecting a minimum of 30% women candidates.
